    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55815" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεργ-ᾰσία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>working up</i>, freq. of
