				675b5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				931a32
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ πυρὸς κ.</span>
			<i>stewing, boiling</i>, Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.59b
			</span></i>: generally, <i>production</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυμῶν</span> (in the body) <i><span class="en">
